, DarwinFPV, DeepSpace, GEPRC, NewBeeDrone - but those brands already seem represented.\n\nHmm, let me look at what's already there more carefully. We have AF1-10. The user says \"these 5 new options\" - but which ones? They directed me to commit changes and push them earlier. Those changes were supposed to include adding 5+ new candidates. Let me check what was actually in the diff that was committed.\n\nLet me check the previous commit diff to see what was actually added.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check what was actually in that previous commit vs what might be missing"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_38d22c7f5a234763a2461ce2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && git diff HEAD~1 -- candidates.sysml | head -80"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && git diff HEAD~1 -- candidates.sysml | head -80\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":43705,"output":715,"cacheRead":18432,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":621,"totalTokens":62852,"cost":{"input":0.004370499999999999,"output":0.000143,"cacheRead":0.00036864,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004882139999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782650883854,"responseId":"gen-1782650884-1JtpWXnSsnQ2W0XPNTu5"}}
