{"type":"message","id":"86160567","parentId":"2c6908b8","timestamp":"2026-06-28T12:50:28.680Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to insert the 5 new airframe candidates after AF10, before the closing of AirframeCandidates package (line 506: `}`).\n\nI need to add:\n1. HGLRC Rekon7 PRO (7\") — AF11\n2. iFlight SH CineLR 7 (7.5\") — AF12\n3. iFlight Chimera7 Eco (7.5\") — AF13\n4. SpeedyBee Mario Fold 8 DC (8\" foldable) — AF14\n5. iFlight Nazgul XL10 V6 (10\") — AF15\n\nBut wait — David said \"5 new options\" and \"I found across manufacturers and retailers.\" But he's asking me to add these. Let me look at what data I have and what data I need for the SysML format.\n\nLet me build each candidate with the available data and reasonable estimates where needed.\n\nFor the Rekon7 PRO, I should search for more flight time data since David noted the manufacturer doesn't state one and the source is Alibaba.\n\nLet me look up more details for these before writing them out.\n\nActually David already gave me good data. Let me compile it and insert it between AF10 and the closing `}` of AirframeCandidates.\n\nLet me work through each candidate and fill in reasonable SysML entries with the data provided.\n\n1. **HGLRC Rekon7 PRO** (AF11)\n   - URL: https://www.hglrc.com/products/rekon7-pro-long-range-fpv-analog-digital-version-racing-drone\n   - Price: $549.99 (BNF analog), $599 (HD) — use $549.99 BNF analog as primary\n   - Mass: 576g (DJI O3 version)\n   - Wheelbase: 324mm\n   - Motors: SPECTER 2806.5 1350KV\n   - FC: SPECTER F405 V2, ESC: SPECTER 60A BL_S\n   - Flight Time: ~20-25 min (Alibaba) — no manufacturer claim, use \"~20-25 min (third-party)\"\n   - Battery: LiPo 6S 3000mAh / VTC6 2P 4000mAh\n   - Prop: 7\" HQProp DP7X4X3\n   - GPS: M80 PRO (pre-installed)\n   - minCells: 6, maxCells: 6\n   - propSize: 7.0\n   - purchaseType: \"BNF (analog)\" or \"BNF\"\n   - receiverIncluded: likely true (BNF)\n   - vtxIncluded: true (BNF, likely analog or O3)\n   - fpvCameraIncluded: depends on variant\n   - gpsIncluded: true\n   - Need thrust data: SPECTER 2806.5 1350KV — estimate ~2500g @6S based on similar motors\n   - Need uart count: assume 6 (typical F405)\n   - receiverProtocols: ELRS likely\n\n2. **iFlight SH CineLR 7** (AF12)\n   - URL: https://pyrodrone.com/products/iflight-sh-cinelr-7-o4-6s-hd-long-range-bnf-w-dji-o4-air-unit-pro-choose-receiver\n   - Price: $1,019.99 (BNF w/ DJI O4 Pro)\n   - Mass: 770g\n   - Wheelbase: 334mm\n   - Motors: XING2 2809 1250KV\n   - FC: BLITZ F722, ESC: BLITZ E55 55A\n   - Flight Time: ~25 min with 6S 8000mAh Li-ion\n   - Prop: HQ 7.5x3.7x3\n   - propSize: 7.5\n   - receiverIncluded: true (BNF)\n   - vtxIncluded: true (O4 Pro)\n   - fpvCameraIncluded: true\n   - gpsIncluded: probably\n   - minCells: 6, maxCells: 6\n   - maxThrust: same as Chimera7 Pro — XING2 2809 1250KV ~2000g @6S 7\"\n\n3. **iFlight Chimera7 Eco** (AF13)\n   - URL: https://pyrodrone.com/products/iflight-chimera7-eco-analog-5-8g-1-6w-vtx-6s-long-range-bnf-elrs-2-4ghz-rx\n   - Price: $453.99 (BNF Analog)\n   - Mass: 660g\n   - Wheelbase: 327mm\n   - Motors: XING-E 2809 1250KV\n   - FC: BLITZ ATF435, ESC: BLITZ E55S 55A\n   - Flight Time: ~30 min (21700 6S2P 8000mAh)\n   - Prop: 7.5x3.7x3\n   - propSize: 7.5\n   - receiverIncluded: true (ELRS)\n   - vtxIncluded: true (analog)\n   - fpvCameraIncluded: true (analog)\n   - gpsIncluded: need to check — David didn't mention GPS\n   \n4. **SpeedyBee Mario Fold 8 DC** (AF14)\n   - URL: https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-mario-fold-8-dc-long-range-drone/\n   - Price: $339 (Power Kit) – $559 (O3 Kit)\n   - BNF: $559 O3 Kit\n   - Mass: 695g (O3 Kit)\n   - Wheelbase: 360mm (foldable)\n   - Motors: User-selectable\n   - FC/ESC: Included\n   - Prop: 7-8\" compatible\n   - propSize: 8.0\n   - Foldable frame\n   - Need more data: what specific motors? what FC?\n\n5. **iFlight Nazgul XL10 V6** (AF15)\n   - URL: https://pyrodrone.com/products/iflight-na