erface: IPEX\n\n- Mounting Hole: 25*25/φ1.6mm\n\n- Weight: 16.5g (Antenna not included)\n\n- Dimensions: 37*31.5*10mm\n\n### Package Includes:\n\n- 1 x Chimera7 ECO 6S Analog BNF\n\n- 1 x Battery pad\n\n- 1 x Antenna\n\n- 2 x Propellers(Pairs)\n\n- 2 x Battery strap\n\nNote:\n\n1. iFlight product is for fun purposes only and does not support autonomous flight.\n\n2. iFlight products may be used for civilian purposes only and any direct or\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7a7076ff0ab12348\">>>","warning":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"751f634f40032753\">>>\nSource: Web Fetch\n---\nResponse body truncated after 750000 bytes.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"751f634f40032753\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1782651041366}}
