m/products/iflight-chimera7-eco-analog-5-8g-1-6w-vtx-6s-long-range-bnf-elrs-2-4ghz-rx\n- Price: $453.99 (BNF Analog)\n- Mass: 660g\n- Wheelbase: 327mm\n- Motors: XING-E 2809 1250KV\n- FC: BLITZ ATF435\n- ESC: BLITZ E55S 55A\n- Flight Time: ~30 min (21700 6S2P 8000mAh)\n- Prop: 7.5X3.7X3\n\n**4. AF14: SpeedyBee Mario Fold 8 DC (8\" foldable)**\n- URL: https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-mario-fold-8-dc-long-range-drone/\n- Price: $339 (Power Kit) – $559 (O3 Kit)\n- Mass: 695g (O3 Kit) — need to verify this from the page\n- Wheelbase: 360mm (foldable)\n- Motors: User-selectable\n- Need more info... let me just fetch the specs.\n\n**5. AF15: iFlight Nazgul XL10 V6 (10\")**\n- URL: https://pyrodrone.com/products/iflight-nazgul-xl10-v6-6s-analog-10-inch-long-range-drone-2-5w-vtx-tbs-crossfire-nano-rx\n- Price: $759.99 (BNF Analog)\n- Mass: 860g\n- Wheelbase: 420mm\n- Motors: XING2 3314 900KV\n- FC: BLITZ F722\n- ESC: BLITZ E55 55A\n- Flight Time: ~40 min hover (21700 6S2P 8000mAh)\n- Prop: HQ 10X4.5X3\n\nLet me get the SpeedyBee Mario Fold 8 specs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_59bbf8093241431dbdada348","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":5000,"url":"https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-mario-fold-8-dc-long-range-drone/","extractMode":"text"},"partialArgs":"{\"maxChars\": 5000, \"url\": \"https://www.speedybee.com/speedybee-mario-fold-8-dc-long-range-drone/\", \"extractMode\": \"text\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":9764,"output":1135,"cacheRead":47360,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":1030,"totalTokens":58259,"cost":{"input":0.0009764,"output":0.000227,"cacheRead":0.0009472,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0021506}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782651041385,"responseId":"gen-1782651042-DpytfGm0HShqrGJtOGNb"}}
