{"type":"message","id":"23888c91","parentId":"91a14ad1","timestamp":"2026-06-29T01:39:01.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about \"SPC\" which stands for System Performance Characteristics (or similar). Looking at the model, I don't find anything by that specific acronym. Let me search the full model for key performance specs that would constitute the SPCs - the cruising altitude, speed, flight time, range, etc.\n\nLooking at the requirements, the key performance specs are:\n\n- **R1:** Cruise altitude 90-120m AGL\n- **R2:** Ground speed 2.23 m/s\n- **R6:** 30 min flight time\n- **R7:** 2800m range at 2.2 m/s in 4.5 m/s wind\n- **R8:** Stretch: 60 min\n- **R3:** Thermal detection/classification at those altitudes\n- **R4:** $2500 total\n\nThese ARE the System Performance Characteristics (SPCs). There's no explicit \"SPC\" section/package in the model - the requirements themselves are the SPCs.\n\nLet me also check if there's any compiled analysis or summary file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_o3JRCmkyKbwfT4ytTiTK7133","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -rni 'SPC\\|KPP\\|critical.*param\\|driving.*requirement' --include='*.md' --include='*.sysml' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v '.git/' | grep -v 'node_modules' | head -20"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -rni 'SPC\\\\|KPP\\\\|critical.*param\\\\|driving.*requirement' --include='*.md' --include='*.sysml' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v '.git/' | grep -v 'node_modules' | head -20\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1172,"output":348,"cacheRead":66816,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":225,"totalTokens":68336,"cost":{"input":0.00011719999999999999,"output":0.0000696,"cacheRead":0.00133632,"cacheWrite":0,"tota