{"type":"message","id":"c80aaba9","parentId":"d66f241d","timestamp":"2026-06-29T01:39:12.917Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about \"SPC\" which likely means \"System Performance Characteristics\" or \"System Performance Criteria\" - the key driving requirements that define what this build needs to achieve. Let me check what we have in the model for top-level requirements and any summary documentation that captures the key performance specs.\n\nFrom the model.sysml, I can see the core requirements:\n\n- R1: Operating altitude 90-120m AGL\n- R2: Steady ground speed 2.23 m/s\n- R3: Thermal detect/classify deer, turkey, animals, humans at night with ≥5°C ΔT\n- R4: Total cost < $2,500\n- R5: Minimize DIY soldering\n- R6: ≥30 min sustained flight time (no wind)\n- R7: ≥2800m surveillance range at 2.2 m/s in 4.5 m/s wind\n- R8: Stretch goal: 60 min flight time\n\nThese are the key SPCs (System Performance Characteristics) that drive the trade space. Let me just give a concise summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"text","text":"Here's a quick recap of the **system performance characteristics (SPCs)** that drive this build — they're defined in `model.sysml` under `package Requirements`:\n\n| SPC | Value |\n|-----|-------|\n| **R1** — Cruising altitude | 90–120 m AGL |\n| **R2** — Ground speed | 2.23 m/s (steady cruise) |\n| **R3** — Thermal mission | Detect & classify deer, turkey, animals, humans at night with ≥5°C ΔT |\n| **R3_1** — Detection | ≥90% confidence at 120m |\n| **R3_2** — Classification | ≥80% confidence at 90m |\n| **R4** — Total system cost | **<$2,500** |\n| **R5** — Assembly complexity | Minimize DIY soldering |\n| **R6** — Flight time (min) | **≥30 min** sustained (0 m/s wind) |\n| **R7** — Surveillance range | **≥2,800 m** at 2.2 m/s in 4.5 m/s wind |\n| **R8** — Stretch goal | 60 min sustained flight |\n\nThe two hardest drivers are **R4 ($2,500 total)** and **R6 (≥30 min flight)** — those are what filter the candidate sweep. The new candidates (Rekon7 PRO at 464g, Chimera7 Eco at $454) are strong contenders on both fronts."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":158,"output":552,"cacheRead":67968,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":232,"totalTokens":68678,"cost":{"input":0.000015799999999999998,"output":0.0001104,"cacheRead":0.00135936,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00148556}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782697141330,"responseId":"gen-1782697142-5XcDomAh5ymOPFw4SD1h"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e91d729e-b4b6-495a-bc6f-37eea0cb3867","parentId":"c80aaba9","timestamp":"2026-06-29T01:39:14.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a quick recap of the **system performance characteristics (SPCs)** that drive this build — they're defined in `model.sysml` under `package Requirements`:\n\n| SPC | Value |\n|-----|-------|\n| **R1** — Cruising altitude | 90–120 m AGL |\n| **R2** — Ground speed | 2.23 m/s (steady cruise) |\n| **R3** — Thermal mission | Detect & classify deer, turkey, animals, humans at night with ≥5°C ΔT |\n| **R3_1** — Detection | ≥90% confidence at 120m |\n| **R3_2** — Classification | ≥80% confidence at 90m |\n| **R4** — Total system cost | **<$2,500** |\n| **R5** — Assembly complexity | Minimize DIY soldering |\n| **R6** — Flight time (min) | **≥30 min** sustained (0 m/s wind) |\n| **R7** — Surveillance range | **≥2,800 m** at 2.2 m/s in 4.5 m/s wind |\n| **R8** — Stretch goal | 60 min sustained flight |\n\nThe two hardest drivers are **R4 ($2,500 total)** and **R6 (≥30 min flight)** — those are what filter the candidate sweep. The new candidates (Rekon7 PRO at 464g, Chimera7 Eco at $454) are strong contenders on both fronts."}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"total":0,"prompt_tokens":0,"completion_tokens":0,"total_tokens":0,"cache":{"read":0,"write":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782697154411}}
