{"type":"message","id":"b888fba1","parentId":"e6a8206d","timestamp":"2026-06-29T01:40:02.423Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the SPC (System Performance Characteristics) and the SBC selection. Let me summarize what I know:\n\n1. **SPCs** — These are the requirements (R1-R8) in model.sysml\n2. **SBC candidates** — Listed in candidates.sysml under SbcCandidates (SBC1 = Radxa ZERO 2 Pro, SBC2 = Orange Pi 5, SBC3 = NanoPi M5)\n\nFrom reading the file earlier, there's a comment in SbcCandidates that mentions:\n- Recommendation: SBC3 NanoPi M5 — confirmed RKNN AND <=10W passive (meets R4_SBC_PWR + no-active-cooling, which SBC2 fails); ~1.6 min less hover than the lighter SBC1, but SBC1's Amlogic toolchain is the weak link.\n\nBut I'm not sure if a final decision/selection was made. Let me check if there's any resolution about which SBC was actually selected.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9f3a798dde0140fbac1e32e1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && python3 -c \"\n# Check session history for SBC decision\nimport os, subprocess\nresult = subprocess.run(['git', 'log', '--all', '--oneline', '--grep=SBC', '-20'], capture_output=True, text=True)\nprint('=== Git log (SBC mentions) ===')\nprint(result.stdout)\n\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && python3 -c \\\"\\n# Check session history for SBC decision\\nimport os, subprocess\\nresult = subprocess.run(['git', 'log', '--all', '--oneline', '--grep=SBC', '-20'], capture_output=True, text=True)\\nprint('=== Git log (SBC mentions) ===')\\nprint(result.stdout)\\n\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":69624,"output":354,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":215,"totalTokens":69978,"cost":{"input":0.006962